    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing spends days trying to refine it without success; the Gu still carries Xiong Zhan’s will and hates Bai Ning Bing more because of that death. During the chase, Bai Ning Bing throws the Gu. Fang Yuan catches it, and Spring Autumn Cicada aura lets him refine it at once and keep it in his aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          138
        ],
